 image. Because you are physically discarding pixels from the edges of the image, the total amount of pixel data decreases. When the crop is exported, the resulting file will contain fewer bytes, making it load faster on websites. This also means less bandwidth usage for your visitors.\"}]]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"details\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"cursor\":\"pointer\",\"padding\":\"0.5rem 0\",\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"alignItems\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"Can I crop images on mobile devices?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.25rem\",\"color\":\"var(--success)\"},\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\",\"margin\":\"0.5rem 0 0 0\",\"paddingTop\":\"0.5rem\",\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"},\"children\":\"Yes, our image cropper is fully mobile-friendly. You can upload an image from your smartphone or tablet, adjust the crop box using touch controls, zoom in or out, select standard aspect ratios, and download the cropped file directly to your device's photo library using your mobile browser. No app installation is required.\"}]]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"details\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"card\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"cursor\":\"pointer\",\"padding\":\"0.5rem 0\",\"listStyle\":\"none\",\"display\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"alignItems\":\"center\"},\"children\":[\"Is image cropping permanent?\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.25rem\",\"color\":\"var(--success)\"},\"children\":\"+\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted\",\"style\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.9rem\",\"margin\":\"0.5rem 0 0 0\",\"paddingTop\":\"0.5rem\",\"borderTop\":\"1px solid var(--border-color)\"